says Ryan Gardner, a regional director with Hays Recruitment.

709
01:24:34,115 --> 01:24:53,735
And the ability to do that is to make sure that the players are not able to do that.

710
01:24:39,123 --> 01:24:46,724
Does that mean your top 100 rankings in Overwatch should go down on your CV?

711
01:24:47,443 --> 01:24:51,663
It's about how you either make it relevant to the job you're applying for

712
01:24:51,663 --> 01:24:56,663
or how it makes you more interesting as a potential employee, Mr. Gardner says.

713
01:24:57,283 --> 01:25:04,583
Two years ago, a Glasgow University study made headlines for suggesting gaming could make students more successful,

714
01:25:04,583 --> 01:25:09,063
but the research hasn't changed minds, at least not yet.

715
01:25:09,123 --> 01:25:12,363
Says one of the authors of the study, Dr. Matthew Barr.

716
01:25:13,103 --> 01:25:15,243
He's now writing a book on the topic.

717
01:25:16,243 --> 01:25:23,123
For now, I think the stigma around games means that telling someone you're a hardcore gamer

718
01:25:23,123 --> 01:25:26,184
is more likely to harm your chances of getting a job.

