723
01:25:42,123 --> 01:25:43,503
We're going to look at the options.

724
01:25:45,724 --> 01:25:52,783
Playing games casually without thinking much about the skills you're using is unlikely to help your career prospects,

725
01:25:52,783 --> 01:25:59,783
but part of Game Academy's pitch is to transform casual gamers into conscious ones,

726
01:25:59,783 --> 01:26:03,863
