745
01:28:32,391 --> 01:28:45,192
When creating treatment plans, the aim is to optimize the radiation dose to the tumor and restrict it as much as possible to healthy surrounding tissue and organs, he says.

746
01:28:45,612 --> 01:28:52,451
It's about repeating the process, but each time doing something slightly different to improve the result.

747
01:28:52,451 --> 01:28:57,391
Just like achieving a high score or a perfect run in a video game.

748
01:28:57,751 --> 01:29:06,231
Most video games are essentially puzzles to solve, he says, and problem solving is a big part of my job.

749
01:29:14,195 --> 01:29:33,195
